    "description": "[Foundation pack] Cyber Essentials v3.3 User Access Control (Danzell A2). Sole owner of the DeviceLock password-composition block: password required, simple passwords blocked, alphanumeric complexity, 14-character minimum, 24-password history, and no forced expiry (NIST-aligned). Rebuilt as a Settings Catalog policy because Windows 11 rejects the equivalent windows10GeneralConfiguration template CSPs with 0x82aa0002. Lock timeout and account-lockout threshold are NOT set here - CE-SC-003 owns those. Do not add MaxInactivityTimeDeviceLock or MaxDevicePasswordFailedAttempts to this policy or the two will conflict on the same CSP node. Pack 1.1.0.",
